Package: riakctl
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: libriak-c2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Replaces: libriak-c-tools (<< 2.2.2)
Breaks: libriak-c-tools (<< 2.2.2)
Description: command-line client for Riak KV
 riakctl, a scriptable command-line client for Riak KV built on libriak-c:
 objects, backup and restore, queries, data types, bucket properties,
 Search, AAE and replication, with JSON output.
